{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/bioscoop.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Theater de Zilvermaan (the city, district 2: the Munt): the art-deco picture palace's lobby: red carpet, brass and velvet ropes, the ticket booth, the sweets counter, the cloakroom with the coats still on their hooks, the posters for tonight; the doors to the auditorium chained shut. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
